<title>USA: Capital Realty shrs delisting.</title>
<headline>Capital Realty shrs delisting.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRI Inc said Thursday that its Capital Realty Investors Tax Exempt Fund series I, II and III will be delisted from the American Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>The CRITEF partnerships yesterday closed the previously approved mergers of CRITEF-I, CRITEF-II and CRITEF-III with affliliates of Capital Apartment Properties Inc, CRI spokesman James Pastore said.</p>
<p>At the closing the interests of all holders of beneficial assignee certificates were cancelled, the company said.</p>
<p>The partnerships will be delisted by close of business Thursday, Pastore said.</p>
</text>
